== update of a dot fit
stored formula: y ~ x1 + x2 + g 
update(newdata = d2 with an extra column) fixef: Intercept x1 x2 g2 g3 g4 g5 g6 
update(. ~ . + I(x1^2)) fixef: Intercept x1 x2 g2 g3 g4 g5 g6 Ix1E2 
update(. ~ . - x2) fixef: Intercept x1 g2 g3 g4 g5 g6 
update(bf(~ ., family = acat())): acat Intercept[1],Intercept[2],x1,x2,g2,g3,g4,g5,g6 
update(~ ., family = acat()): acat 
update(bf(~ ., sigma ~ x1)): Intercept,sigma_Intercept,x1,x2,g2,g3,g4,g5,g6,sigma_x1 
update(bf(. ~ . + (1 | g))): b_Intercept,b_x1,b_x2,b_g2,b_g3,b_g4,b_g5,b_g6,sd_g__Intercept,sigma 
bf delta family wins over family =: student 
update(bf(y ~ x2)) fixef: Intercept x2 
update(bf(~ . + x2)) of bf(y ~ x1, sigma ~ x2): Intercept,sigma_Intercept,x1,x2,sigma_x2 
update(bf(~ ., sigma ~ 1)) replaces sigma: Intercept,sigma_Intercept,x1 
nl update(bf(~ ., a ~ x2)): b_Intercept,a_Intercept,a_x2 
